<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-03T17:58:01.363Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:58:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi authorities have arrested several suspected smugglers linked to a boat sinking that killed three children in Erbil and to a child death case in Erbil, while Kurdish security forces also detained a smuggling suspect in a separate incident. Turkish troops have partially withdrawn from the Zilkan camp in Nineveh, and a drug squad in Kirkuk dismantled a trafficking ring operating across the border. A Jewish museum opened in Baghdad and Uzbekistan announced a trade centre in Erbil, reflecting efforts to attract foreign investment. Iran's parliament speaker reportedly met Iraqi militia leaders, and US officials signaled readiness to assist Erbil after a recent missile strike. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNS0MzVldrNGpDclRUbUp6WHVpZjkzeWoxcE4xOFdHeFhMWi0ySV9sdU1OakYzWnU3aTRkVUNvVVY0eVFzbU1XcWFHNm9NY3k0ZDMtZUtVQi1TZ2Q3TlV4WFIwTUlnQlZ2TVFEMkRwcUc1QngtSXQ5TkwzMXhuYUVmRFAyZjZVTzRkWWtZbFBTTTRsQnVtS0E3a0ZURzBIeGo3QllSSUR5T0NMM0p6Ti1FdjJQZmJxbEU1eGNnQ3V6aW5nWUdWU0tyMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxON0YzZVhULTdraC1CaVNtMGxtamhmYUpKdUw5V2s0cHhZSzhYYzVMaDJ4Y2E0eG53SnBZWXh5blJKR0lpVXNGYV84UklvRTFZaFdiWnJKdmYxRXFtT1lkNzQwMHJxNU5pVm9HQnBKbTNZUGFGMEt0LWxYdjRBTm9GWTdndVMwaDVEaHRMX0Ixd0dYTDUyLUN0UTZ0eThRZzg5?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxNdnUtdXp5Xzh5V0pmeVlOSXliRnhaTmRRTjc5Tm9KWGV4dWcxOS13VEx0RVhia2twSnRpc05XYVV1YmFlRE1xWVhOZGxXdjhCQjRpbk1oRVdZdVlJNGRrMmFQMWRhcUdmM0ZrYVFvbUJyQ2pBWHYydkhqZTBMSjRVNnMwMm81RHpNLXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;CTV News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPQjJxUlNWNmtTdmVRZUVKQm9NVEVONDhtbmk4WVl0T2RreUtUSHVaV1N